							<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="875" height="450" src="https://www.sisma.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Case-study-SOFAB.jpg" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-25403" alt="" srcset="https://www.sisma.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Case-study-SOFAB.jpg 875w, https://www.sisma.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Case-study-SOFAB-300x154.jpg 300w, https://www.sisma.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Case-study-SOFAB-768x395.jpg 768w, https://www.sisma.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Case-study-SOFAB-600x309.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 875px) 100vw, 875px">								</a>
